voc.txt is a merge of data from:

* The original Snowball spanish/voc.txt which is licensed as BSD 3-clause (as
  described in ../COPYING)

* A small number of hand selected words to provide better test coverage for
  changes to the algorithm:

  devolvérsela
  construyéndose
  excluyéndose
  incluyendome
  incluyéndose
  distribuyéndose
  sustituyéndolo

The word lists were merged like so:

  LANG=C sort -u voc.txt voc1.txt > spanish/voc.txt

output.txt was generated from voc.txt by running it through the stemmer:

  stemwords -l spanish -c UTF_8 -i spanish/voc.txt -o spanish/output.txt
